  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "145",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 145"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "145",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Louange de David.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Je t'exalterai, mon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.145.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.145.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", ô Roi ! et je bénirai ton nom à toujours et à perpétuité.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je te bénirai chaque jour, et je louerai ton nom à toujours et à perpétuité.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "L'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.145.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.145.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "est grand et fort digne de louange ; et sa grandeur est insondable.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Une génération célébrera tes œuvres auprès de l'autre génération, et elles raconteront tes actes puissants.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je parlerai de la magnificence glorieuse de ta majesté, et de tes actes merveilleux.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et ils diront la force de tes actes terribles, et [moi], je déclarerai tes grands faits.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ils feront jaillir la mémoire de ta grande bonté, et ils chanteront hautement ta justice.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "L'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.145.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.145.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "est plein de grâce et miséricordieux, lent à la colère, et grand en bonté.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "L'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.145.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.145.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "est bon envers tous, et ses compassions sont sur toutes ses œuvres.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toutes tes œuvres te célébreront, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.145.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.145.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! et tes saints",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "te béniront ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ils parleront de la gloire de ton royaume, et ils diront ta puissance,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Afin de faire connaître aux fils de l'homme",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ses actes puissants et la magnificence glorieuse de son royaume.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ton royaume est un royaume de tous les siècles, et ta domination est de toutes les générations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "L'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.145.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.145.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "soutient tous ceux qui tombent, et relève tous ceux qui sont courbés.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Les yeux de tous s'attendent à toi, et tu leur donnes leur nourriture en son temps.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tu ouvres ta main, et tu rassasies à souhait tout ce qui a vie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "L'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.145.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.145.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "est juste dans toutes ses voies, et bon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "dans toutes ses œuvres.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "L'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.145.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.145.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "est près de tous ceux qui l'invoquent, de tous ceux qui l'invoquent en vérité.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Il accomplit le souhait de ceux qui le craignent : il entend leur cri, et les sauve.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "L'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.145.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.145.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "garde tous ceux qui l'aiment, et il extermine tous les méchants.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 145:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma bouche dira la louange de l'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.145.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.145.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "; et que toute chair bénisse",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.145.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.145.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "son saint nom, à toujours et à perpétuité.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
